msgctxt "7500@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "The northern marches burn. The Chancellor's agents spread lies; border garrisons turn on one another. The King's messenger finds Raynor — a knight once exiled, now the only soul brave enough to face the dark. \"Reclaim the frontier,\" the messenger whispers. \"The realm's fate rests in your hands.\""
