msgctxt "7518@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "armor"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7519
msgctxt "7519@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "melee"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7520
msgctxt "7520@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "weapon"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7521
msgctxt "7521@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "health potion"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7522
msgctxt "7522@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "mana potion"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7523
msgctxt "7523@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "speed boots"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7524
msgctxt "7524@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "power sword"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7525
msgctxt "7525@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "magic ring"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7526
msgctxt "7526@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "gold coin"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7527
msgctxt "7527@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "item"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7528
msgctxt "7528@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "potion"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7529
msgctxt "7529@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "The border village lies in ruins. Wounded soldiers are everywhere; the healer has run dry."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7530
msgctxt "7530@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "A wandering alchemist stops Raynor: \"Take the mana potion to the eastern shrine, and a health potion to the healer — please, my lord.\""
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7531
msgctxt "7531@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "War does not pause, yet Raynor stops. Pick up the potions and complete both deliveries."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7532
msgctxt "7532@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Bring the mana potion to the Northern Shrine while carrying it."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7533
msgctxt "7533@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Deliver the health potion to the village healer."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7534
msgctxt "7534@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "The healer thanks him through tears. Raynor turns away — the capital's intrigues still churn in the distance."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7535
msgctxt "7535@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Sir Garrek — the northern knight Raynor aided before — will march with him, but his gear is broken and his strength spent."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7536
msgctxt "7536@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Scouts report a power sword in the northern ruins and a magic ring in the southern woods; Garrek's lance was lost again in the last sweep. Raynor will restore his ally to fighting form."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7537
msgctxt "7537@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Find the power sword in the ruins."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7538
msgctxt "7538@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Give the knight lance to Sir Garrek."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7539
msgctxt "7539@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Find the magic ring."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7540
msgctxt "7540@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Garrek grips his lance again, blade and ring aglow: \"Raynor, I will not forget this.\""
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7541
msgctxt "7541@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "An ancient tomb deep in the forest holds the kingdom's war chest. Locals whisper the chest is sealed by altar magic."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7542
msgctxt "7542@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "The chest opens only at the stone altar. Carry it to B2, then press Enter in your inventory to use the treasure."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7543
msgctxt "7543@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Find the mystery treasure in the tomb."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7544
msgctxt "7544@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Bring the mystery treasure to the Stone Altar while carrying it."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7545
msgctxt "7545@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "At the altar, use the mystery treasure from your inventory to claim the gold inside."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7546
msgctxt "7546@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Raynor reaches the stone altar with the sealed treasure. Open your inventory and use it here."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7547
msgctxt "7547@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "The allied blacksmith needs materials to reforge the garrison before the Chancellor's next assault."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7548
msgctxt "7548@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Find the speed boots near the old watchtower."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7549
msgctxt "7549@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Deliver the short sword to the allied blacksmith."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7550
msgctxt "7550@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Deliver the footman armor to the allied blacksmith."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7551
msgctxt "7551@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Hammers ring out. Raynor's garrison finally wears proper steel."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7555
msgctxt "7555@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "mystery treasure"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7556
msgctxt "7556@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "village healer"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7557
msgctxt "7557@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Sir Garrek"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7558
msgctxt "7558@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "allied blacksmith"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7559
msgctxt "7559@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "shrine"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7560
msgctxt "7560@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "The shrine keeper takes the mana potion and murmurs a prayer: \"May light guard Lord Raynor's march.\""
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7561
msgctxt "7561@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "opened treasure chest"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7562
msgctxt "7562@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Another tomb holds a sealed chest bound by altar magic. Raynor needs this gold."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7563
msgctxt "7563@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Carry the chest to the Binding Altar and drop it on the altar to break the seal."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7564
msgctxt "7564@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Find the sealed treasure in the tomb."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7565
msgctxt "7565@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Drop the sealed treasure on the Binding Altar."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7566
msgctxt "7566@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Pick up all the gold coins spilled on the altar."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7567
msgctxt "7567@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Gold spills across the altar! Raynor shouts: \"Quick — bandits are coming!\""
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7568
msgctxt "7568@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "sealed treasure"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7569
msgctxt "7569@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "The counteroffensive nears and the front line starves. A crate of war goods waits by the road — Raynor's last resupply."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7570
msgctxt "7570@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Deliver the crate to the Allied Depot. Drop it on the ground there to hand it over."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7571
msgctxt "7571@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Pick up the war supplies."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7572
msgctxt "7572@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Drop the war supplies at the Allied Depot."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7573
msgctxt "7573@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "The quartermaster salutes: \"Lord Raynor, the men can hold another ten days.\""
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7574
msgctxt "7574@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "war supplies"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7575
msgctxt "7575@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "The Chancellor's lies have finally fooled Garrek — he believes Raynor a usurper and marches to destroy him. At the last hour, the King's sealed letter may set things right."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7576
msgctxt "7576@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Raynor, pick up the letter and deliver it to Garrek at Garrek's Camp. After he reads it, command his escorts and crush the Chancellor's assassins in the south."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7577
msgctxt "7577@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Deliver the secret letter to Sir Garrek."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7578
msgctxt "7578@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Eliminate all traitor guards."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7579
msgctxt "7579@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Garrek breaks the seal and pales. \"I nearly became the Chancellor's blade.\" He swears to stand with Raynor; his escorts join your command."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7580
msgctxt "7580@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "The last assassin falls. Garrek takes a signet token from his armor and gives it to Raynor: \"Take this to Count Roland. Some northern lords won't bow to a letter alone — he knows my token, but he still wants to see your blade.\""
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7586
msgctxt "7586@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "You clasp arms. Roland's knights join as allies and fight on their own."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7587
msgctxt "7587@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "The traitors are routed. The northern host grows stronger."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7588
msgctxt "7588@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "King's sealed letter"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7589
msgctxt "7589@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Sir Garrek"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7590
msgctxt "7590@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Chancellor's assassin"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7591
msgctxt "7591@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "knight escort"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7592
msgctxt "7592@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "footman escort"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7593
msgctxt "7593@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "archer escort"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7597
msgctxt "7597@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "The traitors are broken. Raynor at last commands an army fit to challenge the capital."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7598
msgctxt "7598@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Roland sighs. \"I understand your caution. Take these knights — my compensation to you.\""
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7599
msgctxt "7599@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Accept Count Roland's alliance request."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7600
msgctxt "7600@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "On the eve of the final battle, the Chancellor sent three decoys into the streets — only the third is the real killer. Slay the wrong man and the trail goes cold."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7601
msgctxt "7601@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Eliminate the third footman at Assassin Alley."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7602
msgctxt "7602@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Deliver the short sword to the third messenger at Envoy Cross."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7603
msgctxt "7603@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "The killer falls. Raynor says coldly: \"The Chancellor's web is broken.\""
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7604
msgctxt "7604@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "The messenger takes the sword and kneels: \"Lord Raynor, the capital gates stand open for you.\""
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7605
msgctxt "7605@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Raynor, take the short sword from camp (a royal token). Complete both tasks: kill the third footman at Assassin Alley, and deliver the sword to the third messenger at Envoy Cross. Either order works."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7606
msgctxt "7606@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Wrong target! The trail goes cold — the Chancellor wins. Mission failed."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7607
msgctxt "7607@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Raynor"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7610
msgctxt "7610@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "The outpost has barely taken shape when war horns blare at dawn — the enemy surges forward. Raynor meets them head-on: hold this hard-won base; let no foe cross the threshold."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7611
msgctxt "7611@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "The enemy withdraws, but bones clatter from the graveyard. Undead spread along the border. Raynor brings a priest and must break through the line of death."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7612
msgctxt "7612@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "In a heartbeat, twenty knights fall at the Fallen Knights' Field — the field goes still. Only Raynor's priests remain. Raise the fallen there, then lead the cavalry through the enemy blockade to the Breakthrough Pass."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7613
msgctxt "7613@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "From the high ground, Raynor watches an enemy flying machine sweep in from the sky. If the priest can convert it, the craft may cross walls and water — barriers no ground unit can pass. Fly the converted machine to Far Shore to complete the crossing."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7614
msgctxt "7614@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Dark archers lurk beneath the canopy. Raynor's column is caught in a crossfire — destroy every ambusher to advance."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7615
msgctxt "7615@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Two enemy knights patrol Knight Patrol — a frontal fight would be costly. Your mage tower is already in place. Upgrade an archer into an invisible dark archer, slip past the knights' sight, and pick them off one by one."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7616
msgctxt "7616@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Enemy archers and guard towers outnumber Raynor many times over. Your necromancer can raise the fallen as skeletons and zombies — without this ever-growing undead host, the battle cannot be won. Let the dead fight for you and break through."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7617
msgctxt "7617@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Enemy archers, knights, and towers blanket the field — a direct assault is hopeless. Your necromancer wields two tools: deadly fog slays living troops but has no effect on repairable mechanical buildings such as guard and cannon towers; raise dead turns the fallen into your own army. Blanket the foe with fog, then harvest the corpses into a growing undead host. Without both skills, this chapter cannot be won."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7618
msgctxt "7618@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "One hundred thirty footmen are trapped at the Trapped Host — a dead end with no way out, unable to reach the enemy. Cannon towers loom at Cannon Ridge; only your mage and Raynor at Mage Bridge can cross the bridge thither. Order the mage to recall the footmen to his side, then march on Cannon Ridge and destroy the towers."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7619
msgctxt "7619@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Cannon towers at Grand Battery outrange you — only catapults at Catapult Line can strike back. Ten enemy knights hold Iron Cavalry Field; the catapults will draw their attack on the march, so your knights must shield them. Catapults and knights move at different speeds — group them to march as one, or clear Iron Cavalry Field first (optional), then siege at leisure. Coordination is the lesson here."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7620
msgctxt "7620@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Seven woods on Forest Camp and seven on Gold Clearing form a dense forest — paths to neighboring squares vanish, and Raynor's troops cannot advance. Order a peasant to gather wood until at least one woods is cleared; the dense forest lifts and the road reappears. Then reach Gold Clearing to complete the chapter."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7621
msgctxt "7621@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "A lull in the fighting, but Raynor's contact lies dying by the road. Deliver the health potion to the contact at Scout Post — he holds the latest border intelligence."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7622
msgctxt "7622@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Deliver the health potion to the wounded contact"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7623
msgctxt "7623@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "The contact drinks and struggles upright: \"My lord... the Chancellor spreads rumors in the capital, and seeks to turn the northern lords against one another... it is worse than we thought.\""
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7624
msgctxt "7624@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Rain has washed out the bridge; the river cuts both banks and the allied village is stranded across the water. A few planks still span Broken Bridge — Raynor crosses with a pickaxe and delivers it to the peasants so they can fully restore the crossing."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7625
msgctxt "7625@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "A northern knight lost his lance in a skirmish and wanders the ruins, unable to fight. Raynor has found the weapon — returning it may win another ally for the march."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7626
msgctxt "7626@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "An enemy mage guards suspicious documents, unaware they hold the Chancellor's forged orders. Raynor plays the courier and delivers the spy wand — a dangerous infiltration."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7627
msgctxt "7627@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "The King's messenger spoke of a royal amulet that proves Raynor's mandate from the throne. Raynor enters the misty woods to find it — evidence for the disputes yet to come."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7628
msgctxt "7628@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Find the royal amulet"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7642
msgctxt "7642@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Go to the Fallen Knights' Field and resurrect the fallen knights, then march to the Breakthrough Pass."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7643
msgctxt "7643@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Convert the enemy flying machine, then fly past the barriers to Far Shore."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7644
msgctxt "7644@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Upgrade an archer to a dark archer and destroy the enemy knights."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7645
msgctxt "7645@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Use the necromancer to raise the fallen and destroy all enemy forces."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7646
msgctxt "7646@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Use deadly fog on living enemy troops, then raise the fallen to build an undead host and destroy all enemies."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7647
msgctxt "7647@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Use recall to teleport the footmen from the Trapped Host to the mage, then advance to Cannon Ridge and destroy the enemy cannon towers."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7648
msgctxt "7648@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Escort the catapults to Catapult Line and destroy the enemy cannon towers at Grand Battery."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7649
msgctxt "7649@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Destroy the ten enemy knights at Iron Cavalry Field. (optional)"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7650
msgctxt "7650@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Chop through the forest and send a unit to Gold Clearing."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7700
msgctxt "7700@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Count Roland holds Roland's Grounds. Raynor should carry Sir Garrek's token — deliver it to Roland before the trial of arms can begin."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7701
msgctxt "7701@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Count Roland shouts: \"I know Garrek well — if he thinks you're worthy you must have some skill, but I prefer to speak with strength. Defeat me and my brothers, and I will submit!\""
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7702
msgctxt "7702@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Roland sheathes his sword, grinning through bruises: \"Well fought! I yield. Whether we ally formally is your choice.\""
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7703
msgctxt "7703@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Defeat Count Roland and his two guard knights (they surrender — they do not die)."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7704
msgctxt "7704@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Eliminate all traitor guards."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7705
msgctxt "7705@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "General Vera of the east trusts banners, not speeches. Pick up the royal war banner and deliver it to Vera at Vera's Camp — only then will her troops answer to you."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7706
msgctxt "7706@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Deliver the war banner to General Vera."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7707
msgctxt "7707@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Vera takes the banner and kneels. \"The King's standard is here — my soldiers obey Lord Raynor.\" Her knights fall in under your command."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7708
msgctxt "7708@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Marco the Ironhand holds the south with footmen, archers, and knights at Marco's Camp. No letters, no banners — march to his camp and he will draw steel."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7709
msgctxt "7709@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Raynor must personally defeat Marco the Ironhand in combat (he surrenders — he does not die)."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7710
msgctxt "7710@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Marco tosses his blade aside: \"Good! These four knights obey you; the rest stay with me. Do not disappoint me, Raynor.\""
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7711
msgctxt "7711@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Count Roland"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7712
msgctxt "7712@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "guard knight"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7713
msgctxt "7713@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "General Vera"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7714
msgctxt "7714@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Marco the Ironhand"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7715
msgctxt "7715@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "royal war banner"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7716
msgctxt "7716@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Sir Garrek's token"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7717
msgctxt "7717@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Deliver Sir Garrek's token to Count Roland."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7718
msgctxt "7718@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Marco Ironhand rides forward, steel boots ringing on the stones. He squints at Raynor: \"So you're the Raynor who turned the border upside down. Save your breath — in the north, we settle this with steel!\""
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7719
msgctxt "7719@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "The last assassin falls. Marco laughs from the front rank: \"The Chancellor thought these vermin could spoil my fight? North and south stand as one — the capital gates are ours to open together.\""
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7720
msgctxt "7720@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Twelve hard battles have scarred Raynor's armor layer upon layer. His men say the old wounds have not healed, yet his blade strikes harder and faster than before — skill honed among the dead."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7721
msgctxt "7721@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Raynor tests a full swing; the wind of it could tear leather. He realizes he is no longer a banished knight alone, but a banner the northern soldiers will follow."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7722
msgctxt "7722@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Broken bridges, escorts, ruin after ruin — each risk taught Raynor to walk between lies and steel. His armor is thicker, his charge reaches farther, and every step lands in the enemy's blind spot."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7723
msgctxt "7723@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "The messenger whispers: only deep in enemy lines can he seize proof of the Chancellor's forged orders. Raynor tightens his bracers — this time he walks into the tiger's den himself."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7724
msgctxt "7724@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "The royal amulet rests on his chest; Raynor can finally stand straight against the slander. Years of war have forged him into a war machine — every blow heavier, truer, every guard harder to break."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7725
msgctxt "7725@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Sir Garrek falters again in the north. Raynor understands: true growth is not only becoming stronger himself, but lifting those who fight beside him back to their feet."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7726
msgctxt "7726@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Armories, altars, tombs, and supply lines — Raynor has crossed nearly every mile of the border. His name begins to mean victory; where his blade points, enemies waver."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7727
msgctxt "7727@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "The sealed chest shatters on the altar; gold rings across the stone. Raynor does not gloat. \"The last lesson,\" he says, \"is turning this into the kingdom's sword and shield.\""
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7728
msgctxt "7728@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Raynor stands at last on the edge of a march on the capital. Armor weathered by countless battles gleams anew; his charge thunders, and even veteran lords take notice."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7729
msgctxt "7729@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "The King's sealed letter waits on the table; the Chancellor's lies have already fooled Garrek. Raynor clasps his cloak: this fight is for the realm — and for everyone he has carried this far."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7730
msgctxt "7730@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "The forest clears and the road opens. Raynor reins in at Gold Clearing and looks back — from ruined outpost to coordinated siege, he has learned to build, convert, recall, and march as one. The expansion arc ends; the real intrigue is only beginning."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7731
msgctxt "7731@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Raynor the Veteran"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7732
msgctxt "7732@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Raynor the Infiltrator"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7733
msgctxt "7733@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Raynor the Warden"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7734
msgctxt "7734@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Raynor the Champion"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7735
msgctxt "7735@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Raynor the Border Sword"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7736
msgctxt "7736@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Raynor the Coalition Lord"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7737
msgctxt "7737@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "After Roland's trial and Vera's banner, the northern lords finally sit at one table with Raynor. Endless campaigning has pushed his body to its peak — wounds knit before they fully open, breath itself carries him back to fighting trim."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7738
msgctxt "7738@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "At Marco's camp, steel boots ring on stone. Raynor knows this duel is not for land but for the soul of the northern host — he must prove it with his own blade."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7740
msgctxt "7740@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "A banished knight who has reclaimed the crown's mandate; his march has only begun, and blade and mail still await the forge."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7741
msgctxt "7741@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Hardened by twelve battles — a fiercer strike and stouter mail; the northern soldiers now rally to his banner."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7742
msgctxt "7742@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "An infiltrator who walks between lies and steel; thicker armor and a longer charge carry him deep behind enemy lines."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7743
msgctxt "7743@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "A veteran commander — blows land heavy and guards hold firm, and he lifts fallen allies back into the fight."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7744
msgctxt "7744@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "A border champion whose spoils and supplies become the kingdom's sword and shield; renown and strength rise together."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7745
msgctxt "7745@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "The Border Sword, trusted by the coalition, ready to lead the march on the capital — his charge thunders and will not break."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7746
msgctxt "7746@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Coalition lord, chosen by the generals; battle-hardened with enduring vigor — only he can bear the duel that will bind the north."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7747
msgctxt "7747@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "The Legend of Raynor"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7748
msgctxt "7748@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "The capital march can wait one more day. Scouts report unrest along an uncharted stretch of border — the terrain shifts each season, but the enemy camps do not. Raynor leads a patrol: clear every hostile force on the map and hold your base."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7749
msgctxt "7749@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "The last foe falls on unfamiliar ground. Raynor sheathes his blade: \"The border moves; our duty does not.\""
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7750
msgctxt "7750@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Eliminate all hostile forces and protect your town hall."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7751
msgctxt "7751@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Once exiled, Sir Raynor returns to the northern marches at the King's command. From a ruined outpost through twelve brutal battles, he learns to build, charge, and command. When the Chancellor's lies turn lord against lord, Raynor clears the slander with sealed letters, trials of arms, and banners of fealty — until the northern host names him their coalition lord. The capital gates stand open — yet on the eve of victory, one last assassin still waits in the alleys."
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7752
msgctxt "7752@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "sun-chasing swordplay"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7753
msgctxt "7753@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "skill_moli_dan"
msgstr ""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7754
