#. VOICE_LIB_HELP
#: res/ui/tts.txt:5765
msgctxt "5765"
msgid "The primary voice library is used for menus and player actions outside matches, and for production and economy feedback in matches. If a screen reader such as Zhengdu or NVDA is detected, the screen reader takes over the primary voice role to avoid fighting the primary library."
msgstr "The primary voice library is used for menus and player actions outside matches, and for production and economy feedback in matches. If a screen reader such as Zhengdu or NVDA is detected, the screen reader takes over the primary voice role to avoid fighting the primary library."

#. VOICE_LIB_HELP
#: res/ui/tts.txt:5766
msgctxt "5766"
msgid "Prefer a screen reader as the primary voice when possible, so F9 through F12 need not be used for the primary library. Hotkeys in this game are very dense and nearly saturated, so save keys when you can. The secondary library can still be adjusted with Shift plus F9 through F12."
msgstr "Prefer a screen reader as the primary voice when possible, so F9 through F12 need not be used for the primary library. Hotkeys in this game are very dense and nearly saturated, so save keys when you can. The secondary library can still be adjusted with Shift plus F9 through F12."

#. VOICE_LIB_HELP
#: res/ui/tts.txt:5767
msgctxt "5767"
msgid "The secondary voice library is used for passive battlefield events in matches, such as casualties and discovering enemies."
msgstr "The secondary voice library is used for passive battlefield events in matches, such as casualties and discovering enemies."

#. VOICE_LIB_HELP
#: res/ui/tts.txt:5768
msgctxt "5768"
msgid "Left Alt skips or interrupts the primary voice library. Right Alt skips or interrupts the secondary voice library. In-match actions do not interrupt the secondary library."
msgstr "Left Alt skips or interrupts the primary voice library. Right Alt skips or interrupts the secondary voice library. In-match actions do not interrupt the secondary library."

#. VOICE_LIB_HELP
#: res/ui/tts.txt:5769
msgctxt "5769"
msgid "When secondary voice is disabled, either Alt key can skip the current utterance."
msgstr "When secondary voice is disabled, either Alt key can skip the current utterance."

#. VOICE_LIB_HELP
#: res/ui/tts.txt:5770
msgctxt "5770"
msgid "You can enable or disable secondary voice in this menu. When disabled, the primary voice handles all speech, same as single-channel mode. When enabled, primary and secondary roles are restored."
msgstr "You can enable or disable secondary voice in this menu. When disabled, the primary voice handles all speech, same as single-channel mode. When enabled, primary and secondary roles are restored."

#. VOICE_LIB_HELP
#: res/ui/tts.txt:5771
msgctxt "5771"
msgid "In any menu, press F3 to toggle secondary voice. This does nothing during a match."
msgstr "In any menu, press F3 to toggle secondary voice. This does nothing during a match."

#. VOICE_LIB_HELP
#: res/ui/tts.txt:5772
msgctxt "5772"
msgid "In any menu, press F4 to toggle accessibility voice. When off, TTS is silenced so sighted players can use the display. Press F4 again to turn it back on. During a match, F4 remains the help screen."
msgstr "In any menu, press F4 to toggle accessibility voice. When off, TTS is silenced so sighted players can use the display. Press F4 again to turn it back on. During a match, F4 remains the help screen."

#. VOICE_LIB_HELP
#: res/ui/tts.txt:5773
msgctxt "5773"
msgid "In voice library settings, use up and down arrows to select a parameter, and left and right arrows to adjust it."
msgstr "In voice library settings, use up and down arrows to select a parameter, and left and right arrows to adjust it."

#. VOICE_LIB_HELP
#: res/ui/tts.txt:5774
msgctxt "5774"
msgid "In-match hotkeys: F9 changes the sound card, F10 changes the parameter type, F11 and F12 adjust the current parameter."
msgstr "In-match hotkeys: F9 changes the sound card, F10 changes the parameter type, F11 and F12 adjust the current parameter."

#. VOICE_LIB_HELP
#: res/ui/tts.txt:5775
msgctxt "5775"
msgid "Shift plus F9 through F12 adjust the secondary library. Right Shift plus C copies the latest secondary utterance. Right Shift plus B appends the secondary utterance to the clipboard. Left Shift plus C and Left Shift plus B are commented out by default in global_bindings.txt; remove the leading semicolon to enable them."
msgstr "Shift plus F9 through F12 adjust the secondary library. Right Shift plus C copies the latest secondary utterance. Right Shift plus B appends the secondary utterance to the clipboard. Left Shift plus C and Left Shift plus B are commented out by default in global_bindings.txt; remove the leading semicolon to enable them."

